    "result": "Perfect! The fix is complete and tested. Here's a summary of the changes:\n\n**Root cause:** The `gate` command in the frai CLI was using a variadic argument pattern `[args...]`, but commander.js was parsing the `--ci` flag separately from the positional arguments, so it wasn't being passed through to the frai-gate subprocess.\n\n**Solution:** Changed the action handler to use `process.argv` directly to capture all arguments after the `gate` command (lines 752-753), ensuring that flags like `--ci` are preserved and passed to the frai-gate CLI.\n\n**Verification:** Tested the fixed CLI and confirmed both files are now created:\n- `FRAI-SPEC.md` \u2713\n- `.github/workflows/rai-gate.yml` \u2713\n\nThe package has been rebuilt and the bug is fixed.",
